⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
332 calories 29g protein (for the entire pint, including toppings/mix-ins)

Marshmallow Sky Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 125 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 15g mini marshmallows
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
- 1-2 drops blue food coloring (optional)
Toppings:
- ½ of a package of the @Fuul Snacks Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough bites
- 5g mini lucky-charms-style marshmallows (I used the ones from @jetpuffed)
332 cal 45g C, 4g F, 29g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base (marshmallows included) and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with the cookie dough bites and marshmallows, and mix in by hand

